# Binary assets must never go through line-ending conversion.
#
# The CV is an ASCII85-encoded PDF, so it contains no NUL bytes and git's
# heuristic classifies it as text. With core.autocrlf=true that rewrote every
# LF to CRLF on checkout, shifting the byte offsets in the PDF's xref table and
# leaving the file structurally invalid. Pin these types as binary.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
